From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:21:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/xenos: destination alpha is 1 for color buffers
 without alpha

Blending with DST_ALPHA / ONE_MINUS_DST_ALPHA into an RGBX buffer read the
X channel. Keep a second RB_BLEND_CONTROL with those factors replaced by
ONE / ZERO (and SRC_ALPHA_SATURATE by ZERO) and emit it when the bound
color buffer has no alpha (piglit fbo-blending-formats).

